    """
    From the current Create Product Settings page, proceed to the product form and create
    a simple product named 'Lelelumon Yoga Mat' priced at 769.99, size 'uni-size', color 'black',
    quantity 42, set to In Stock, then SAVE. The Save action is the final action (it may navigate).
